atching, and the Chart Statistics MODAL opened in the live UI with the new 'Knob Load (per second)' row rendering under Hand Balance in the Density block (empty chart -> '0.0 None', never blank), ALL with ZERO JS pageerrors. APP_VERSION bumped to 0.0.76, CHANGELOG + docs Updates section + docs version badge updated. Point 58 added; a knob/Tsumami difficulty metric marked SHIPPED. NEW recommendations building on v0.0.76 (all render-only, no KSON risk): (xx) KNOB LOAD ON THE PREVIEW READOUT -- surface the peak knob-actions/s live in the Game Preview side panel beside the v0.0.71 peak-NPS readout, banded the same, so the Tsumami axis reads live during playback. (yy) PER-MEASURE KNOB STRIP -- a green-to-red per-measure knob-density sparkline, the Tsumami twin of the v0.0.69 Reading-Difficulty Strip, with click-to-seek to the busiest knob burst via knobStress().peakTick. (zz) KNOB LOAD DELTA IN SPLIT VIEW -- show each pane's peak knob load and the delta so two versions' knob difficulty compare directly, mirroring recommendation (mm) for NPS. (a1) SIX-AXIS HONEST RADAR -- combine the five honest axes (reading, NPS, jack, hand balance, knob load) into a single measured profile, an honest counterpart to the stylised radar.js polygon. Orthographic Mode Overhaul (Points 2/6/16/18) remains the top open non-metric item. NOTE: the dated UPDATES log was current through v0.0.75 (no backfill needed this run).\
